# Facts about Sister Amaranth.

@fact amaranth.healer
tier: surface
text: Runs the infirmary and teaches the healing half of Alchemy & Healing. Believes no excuse.

@fact amaranth.truth
tier: personal
hint: Tell her how you really got hurt, and see.
unlock: seen(amaranth_intro) > 0
text: She treats the true version of an injury faster than the story you tell her, and she always knows which one you told.

@fact amaranth.rounds
tier: personal
hint: Watch the infirmary at evening.
unlock: seen(amaranth_rounds) > 0
text: She does evening rounds of every bed herself, and has never once missed one.

@fact amaranth.key
tier: personal
hint: Some students are trusted with more than tonics.
unlock: seen(amaranth_trust) > 0
text: Only a handful of students have ever been trusted with the key to her tonic cupboard.

@fact amaranth.count
tier: personal
hint: Help her restock over a break.
unlock: seen(brk_amaranth_restock) > 0
text: She counts every remedy twice, because the second count is the true one, and keeps a black jar on the top shelf for a curse not seen since her first year.

@fact amaranth.cupboard
tier: personal
hint: Look in the tonic cupboard at teatime.
unlock: seen(infirmary_tonic_cupboard) > 0
text: She leaves the tonic cupboard open at teatime on purpose, to see who will help themselves, and writes their names in a book.

@fact amaranth.book
tier: personal
hint: Invent a remedy under her eye.
unlock: seen(alch_original_remedy) > 0
text: She keeps a book of the remedies her students invented, written out in her own square hand.
